{
  "slug": "csitrep-generator",
  "name": "Csitrep Generator",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Multi-agent Situation Report (SitRep) generator for any project type. Drops 25 specialist AI agents across 5 domains to read your project documents in parallel and synthesizes findings into a structured status report — with critical issues, watch items, and recommended actions classified by urgency. Supports six project types out of the box: Construction (schedule, cost, safety, contracts, site), Software/IT (sprint, budget, quality, blockers, infra), Development Programs (workplan, budget/grants, M&E, stakeholders, field), Product/Manufacturing (timeline, cost, quality, supply chain, ops), Consulting (deliverables, billing, client satisfaction, resources, risks), and Custom (define your own 5 domains). Optional Slack delivery, interactive HTML dashboard, change-tracking across reports, and team-setup automation for recurring delivery.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **15 skills**, **25 agents**, **2 hooks** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (15): `compare` (Compare current SitRep against previous reports to identify trends), `dashboard` (Quick one-line status per domain), `dashboard-ui` (Generate a visual HTML dashboard from the latest SitRep), `feedback` (Flag a finding in a SitRep as incorrect, inaccurate, or needing adjustment), `generate` (Generate a Situation Report (SitRep)), `import` (Import data from common PM tools (Jira, MS Project, Primavera, Procore, Monday.com, Asana, Smartsheet)), `onboard` (Interactive onboarding walkthrough for new users), `schedule` (Set up automated recurring SitRep generation), and 7 more\n- **Agents** (25): `construction-contracts` (Analyzes construction contract documents for RFI status, submittal tracking, and contractual risks), `construction-cost` (Analyzes construction cost and budget documents for variances, burn rate, and change order exposure), `construction-safety` (Analyzes construction safety documents for incidents, compliance gaps, and hazard patterns), `construction-schedule` (Analyzes construction schedule documents for delays, critical path issues, and milestone risks), `construction-site` (Analyzes construction site condition documents for workforce, access, materials, and field issues), `consulting-budget` (Analyzes budget, billing, and profitability for consulting/professional services projects), `consulting-client` (Analyzes client satisfaction, relationship health, and feedback for consulting projects), `consulting-deliverables` (Analyzes deliverable progress and timeline for consulting/professional services projects), and 17 more\n- **Hooks** (2): `SessionStart`, `PostToolUse`\n- **MCP servers** (1): `slack`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install csitrep-generator@claude-community` from `chiKeka/csitrep-generator`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 15,
    "agent": 25,
    "hook": 2,
    "mcp": 1
  },
